			"notes": "**Foundations v1.0.0** officially releases not only as a datapack but also (_experimentally_) as a Fabric and NeoForge mod, bringing an ultra-minimalist survival overhaul to your global game instance. Designed under the Pareto Principle, this update recalibrates Minecraft's core mechanics to restore the resource scarcity and \"dread of the dark\" from the Alpha and Beta eras without cluttering your world with new items. \n\n> **Be warned:** this is not for casual builders. It is a survival-first experience meant to reintroduce a genuine learning curve where \"every\" choice (from crafting a torch to skipping the night) carries some weight."
